there is no question life is weird  everything about it can feel kind of  insane at times the way people act the  way the world works or doesn't the  amount of stress we put ourselves  through the amount of seemingly  meaningless stuff we make ourselves do  essentially we're all weirdly self-aware  animals evolved out of some unknown  source of life doing a bunch of random  stuff that we accept as normal on a  planet that we are stuck to you in the  universe we know essentially nothing  about the concept of life as we know it  is just as much science fiction as any  science fiction film or book ever made  in a lot of ways the strangeness and  complexity of life can be overwhelming  and depressing the fact that we can't  understand or be in control of  everything the fact that there could be  misfortune uncertainty and just plain  weirdness all of this can make us feel  confused and small like we are nothing  more than clueless insignificant beings  strung along by life in its absurdity  with no clear direction or purpose but  what separates someone who is able to  still lead a happy positive life in  spite of all this mayhem of existing  from someone who cannot it's how one  deals with the notion of life's  weirdness what separates a positive  meaningful existence from a negative  empty one as predicated by what angle  you are looking at life from the side  that finds anguish in the fact that we  barely understand anything about the  life we live or the side that finds  fascination and intrigue in the mystery  the side that finds spite and anger and  the fact that we cannot control or  predict things in the future or the side  that finds excitement in the fact that  we can't always be certain of what's to  come  the side that finds contempt in the  weirdest of nature and humanity or the  side that finds humor at all we can view  live from one of these two sides the  positive or the negative sure things  aren't always roses and sometimes stuff  is just negative by nature but we can  choose which side we want to build our  home on the side that gets the Sun or  the side that's always in the shade  every day we can choose to try to make  the most of things and revert back to  the positive side as often as possible  we can choose to remind ourselves that  life is so weird and so insane and we  are lucky enough to get the privilege of  being able to experience observe and  explore it whether it is a work day at a  job we don't like a lazy day at home or  we don't feel productive or a day that  we had to sacrifice to some  time-consuming task no day is ever truly  wasted or lived in vain so long as even  if just for a moment  to acknowledge and appreciate the insane  perplexing weird profound and  fascinating life we get to be a part of  and likewise even if a day is filled  with money Fame and achievement no day  is ever truly a success without doing  the same no matter who you are or what  you did today any day that you remember  to acknowledge life in all of its  weirdness from a place of positivity is  a success and today is not over thank  you for watching if you found enjoyment  and value in this video please give it a  thumbs up share your thoughts in the  comments below and if you are not  already be sure to subscribe to our  Channel  we are constantly coming out with new  videos to help you experience life with  clarity and Wonder
 

